WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
(piano music)

00:00:03.922 --> 00:00:06.672
(record scratch)

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:14.907
- Hey.
- Oh, hey. How's it going?

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:16.607
- Oh, uh.
- Um, do you want--?

00:00:16.607 --> 00:00:18.798
- Uh, yeah. We can...

00:00:18.798 --> 00:00:20.109
Hug and a handshake, alright!

00:00:20.109 --> 00:00:20.942
- Great.

00:00:35.225 --> 00:00:36.058
- OK...

00:00:37.182 --> 00:00:38.395
- Hey.
- Hey.

00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:39.276
- Happy birthday.

00:00:39.276 --> 00:00:42.491
- Oh thanks, Claire. You too.

00:00:42.491 --> 00:00:43.324
- I won't be able to.

00:00:43.324 --> 00:00:46.501
- You're always really busy though.

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:48.501
(gasps)

00:00:50.621 --> 00:00:51.816
- I'm so sorry!

00:00:51.816 --> 00:00:54.483
- That's my fault...
- Oh my God.

00:00:56.939 --> 00:00:57.772
- No. No!

00:01:00.224 --> 00:01:01.057
No!

00:01:01.944 --> 00:01:02.777
Aww...

00:01:04.006 --> 00:01:05.044
- It was great meeting you, Joe.

00:01:05.044 --> 00:01:06.047
Thanks for coming in.

00:01:06.047 --> 00:01:06.916
- Thanks so much for having me.

00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:07.749
- Absolutely.

00:01:07.749 --> 00:01:08.582
I think you're going to be

00:01:08.582 --> 00:01:10.086
a great candidate for this position.

00:01:10.086 --> 00:01:11.194
Do you have any questions for me?

00:01:11.194 --> 00:01:12.367
- Uh, yeah, just...

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.333
Who do I have to interview
with to get your job?

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:15.863
(awkward laugh)

00:01:15.863 --> 00:01:16.863
- I don't...

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.414
- Totally the best movie of the year--

00:01:19.414 --> 00:01:21.997
(loud thud)
Ow!

00:01:27.814 --> 00:01:28.647
That's OK.

00:01:28.647 --> 00:01:30.445
- Can I still put the number in?

00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:31.591
- Yeah, of course.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.591
- I'm sorry.

